  - id: fine_flour
    displayName: Fine Flour
    flavorText: The grain offering - fine flour, oil, and frankincense.
    tierType: 0
    purpose: The one bloodless offering - fine flour, oil, and frankincense. Represents
      the fruit of ordinary daily labor being given back to God, not just dramatic
      sacrifice.
