  - id: leprosy_cloth
    displayName: Leprosy Cloth
    flavorText: Purity laws - childbirth, skin disease, mold, and bodily discharges.
    tierType: 0
    purpose: Covers childbirth, skin disease, mold in clothing/houses, and bodily
      discharges - the common thread is anything involving blood, death, or decay
      disrupting the boundary between life and death that holiness requires guarding.
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
    managerId: purity_laws
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
