  - id: holiness_tablet
    displayName: Holiness Tablet
    flavorText: The Holiness Code - "thou shalt love thy neighbour as thyself."
    tierType: 0
    purpose: 'Extends holiness from ritual into ethics - sexual morality, honesty
      in business, care for the poor and the stranger, honoring the elderly. Explicitly
      grounds all of it in one repeated line: ''Ye shall be holy: for I the LORD
      your God am holy'' (19:2) - holiness isn''t only what happens at the altar.'
    deliveredByManagerId: moses
    managerId: holiness_code
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 43fe0cf1aa4553a4ea9980ea6b464600, type: 3}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 2971.6
